      "writtenOn": "2024-03-25T13:29:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Wow, that\u0027s weird! I don\u0027t know why they would use silicon on an op like this!\n\nI\u0027d recommend `__lasx_xvfmadd_s(-f, m, a)` as a less confusing alternative and avoid `__lasx_xvfnmadd_s` entirely.",
      "parentUuid": "02114943_1bc7c295",
